WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.014
Modularity works best when each layer has one
responsibility Base

00:00:06.028 --> 00:00:12.005
tables store source facts A shared view can own
stable relational logic

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:19.273
A report-level CTE can own a temporary threshold
ranking rule or sequence calculation

00:00:21.023 --> 00:00:27.084
The final query produces the consumer-specific
result This separation

00:00:27.111 --> 00:00:29.505
makes each layer easier to test and change
